llerUrl": "http://www.hispalix.com/apps/mininigma/index.html", "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN"], "fileSizeBytes": "36982784", "formattedPrice": "￦3,300", "trackContentRating": "4+", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 0, "artistId": 334855347, "artistName": "Horacio Jimenez", "genres": ["유틸리티", "엔터테인먼트"], "price": 3300.0, "primaryGenreName": "Utilities", "primaryGenreId": 6002, "bundleId": "jimenez.horacio.myenigma", "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled": true, "sellerName": "Horacio Jimenez", "releaseDate": "2009-10-15T22:58:29Z", "trackId": 334855344, "trackName": "Mininigma: Enigma Simulator", "genreIds": ["6002", "6016"], "currentVersionReleaseDate": "2026-06-24T00:31:17Z", "version": "4.5.2", "wrapperType": "software", "currency": "KRW", "description": "Mininigma is a complete simulator of an Enigma Machine  for your iPhone/iPad/iPod Touch.\n\nBasically, Enigma was a cipher machine used by the Germans during World War II for the encryption and decryption of secret messages. It looked like an old typewriter with some extra features.\n\nBeing fully compatible with the real Enigma means you can also use Mininigma to decode any of the original messages which can be found on Internet.\n\nYou can also generate a machine configuration based on a keyword or keyphrase. That means you'll only have to share that keyword to send a message!!\n\nMininigma can accurately simulate different types of machines: The Enigma I, M3 and M4, Railway, G-312, or Swiss-K, with some others coming in the future. You can read more about these, as always, on the Wikipedia :)\n\nYou can actually select between the different machine types and setup them as you would with a real one: choose rotors, configure them, or use a plugboard to switch letters. All at the tip of your finger.\n\nMininigma supports Copy/Paste to allow you to interact with any other application on your device. You can even copy/paste machine configurations in an encryptable string!!", "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "averageUserRating": 0, "minimumOsVersion": "13.0", "trackCensoredName": "Mininigma: Enigma Simulator", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/mininigma-enigma-simulator/id334855344?uo=4", "userRatingCount": 0}]}